 The Lakeside Windsurf School teaches windsurfing on the lake from April to October, and rents boards and
 sails to its students and to visitors who bring their own experience. This repository holds the software
 of its booking desk, written in TypeScript with no runtime dependency.
+
+## Rentals
+
+```ts
+import { createRentalService } from './src/index.ts';
+
+const rentals = createRentalService();
+rentals.addEquipment({ id: 'b1', kind: 'board', dailyPrice: 2500 }); // euro cents
+const request = { itemId: 'b1', start: '2026-07-01T00:00:00.000Z', end: '2026-07-03T00:00:00.000Z' };
+rentals.quote(request); // { itemId, start, end, total: 5000 }
+rentals.book(request);  // { id, itemId, start, end, total: 5000 }
+```
+
+Periods are whole days at midnight UTC; `end` is the start of the day after the last day. `quote` and
+`book` throw for an unknown item or invalid period, and `book` throws if the item is already booked for
+any part of it. Cancellation is not implemented yet.
